{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02748","headline":"中和乐九章 歌南郊第四 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌南郊第四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虔郊上帝，肃事圆丘。\n龙驾四牡，鸾旗九斿。\n钟歌晚引，紫炀高浮。\n日丽苍璧，云飞鸣球。\n皇之庆矣，万寿千秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}